<section class="section"><div class="wrap about-grid"><img class="about-photo" src="{{ 'founder.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Photo from JobPlug’s founder story" width="1600" height="2133" loading="lazy"><div class="about-copy"><span class="eyebrow">The person behind the plug</span><h2>It started with helping a friend.</h2><p>Before JobPlug, there were friends looking for internships and wondering where to begin. Sharing practical strategies led to introductions, referrals, and a bigger purpose.</p><p>That experience became JobPlug: personalized career support built around the belief that talented people deserve direction, clarity, and someone in their corner.</p><p>Today, that mission extends across industries—from tech and engineering to skilled trades, leadership, customer support, and creative work.</p><a class="text-link" href="/pages/free-consultant">Meet your next step ↗</a></div></div></section>
